    "description": "<table style=\"width:100%; margin-top:1em; border:1px solid #999; font-size:90%; text-align:center; background:#363636\"> \n <tbody>\n  <tr> \n   <td><i>This article details the Chain Survival Gear found in the Core Rulebook. You may be looking for the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Homebrew_Content\" title=\"Homebrew Content\">Homebrew Content</a> Simple Weapon (Melee) of the same name, the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Chain_(Weapon)\" title=\"Chain (Weapon)\">Chain</a>.</i> </td>\n  </tr>\n </tbody>\n</table><p>This 3-meter (2-square) length of Chain has <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Damage_Reduction\" title=\"Damage Reduction\">Damage Reduction</a> of 10, and 5 hit points. It has a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Strength\" title=\"Strength\">Strength</a> score of 44, can safely support over 5 metric tons of weight, and it can be broken with a DC 32 <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Strength\" title=\"Strength\">Strength</a> check. </p>",
